/scene-clips/7440.mp4","videoBytes":277411,"duration":4.041667},"4d035bcb5621":{"text":"Should teenagers be more cautious?","id":"4d035bcb5621","source":"BTS 34 · #40","image":"/img/scene-clips/7448.webp","imageBytes":24088,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7448.mp4","videoBytes":140838,"duration":4.041667},"4b689c36ba97":{"text":"The future is full of possibilities.","id":"4b689c36ba97","source":"BTS 34 · #19","image":"/img/scene-clips/7491.webp","imageBytes":16256,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7491.mp4","videoBytes":98582,"duration":4.041667}},"examples":["Think of one person you saw with an interesting talent.","Where did you see that person?","What stunt did that person do?","Why do you think some people do things that are dangerous?","Do you listen to music from other countries?","If yes, why do you like them?","Do you know any traditional music from your country?","How unique is Korean traditional music?","What are your hopes and dreams for the future?","Who inspires you to pursue your dreams?","The future is full of possibilities.","I dream of becoming a famous scientist.","My biggest dream is to travel around the world.","What would you do if you could do anything?","I would start my own company.","Never stop dreaming and working hard.","Believe in yourself and you can achieve anything.","What happened when you finally took that risk?","Have you ever dared your friend to do something risky?","What is the biggest risk you have ever taken?","Sometimes you have to take risks to succeed.","Do you think teenagers take more risks than adults?","I am not afraid to try new things.","Did you try again after failing?","Why is self-belief important?","What is the most important thing in your life?","Do you regret any risks you've taken?","Are some risks worth taking and others not?","Is peer pressure related to risk-taking?","How do you decide if a risk is worth it?","Have you learned from taking risks?","Do you think success requires taking risks?","What's the scariest thing you've ever done?","Did you overcome your fear?","How did it feel after you did it?","Do your parents support you taking risks?","What kind of risks do your friends take?","How do you resist negative peer pressure?","Should teenagers be more cautious?","Have you ever seen someone get hurt from taking a risk?","Do you think adventure requires risk?","What traditional instruments are used in Korean music?","Have you heard traditional Korean music?","Is traditional music still popular?","Should we preserve traditional music?","How is Korean music different from Western music?","Would you want to be a K-pop star?","What's your favorite K-pop group?","Why are they popular internationally?","What dreams do you have for your career?","Do you think your dreams are achievable?","What steps are you taking to achieve them?","Have your dreams changed over time?","What's a dream you had as a child?","What do you want to be when you grow up?","How will you prepare for that career?","Do you need more education for your dream job?","Are you willing to work hard for your dreams?","Do distractions prevent you from achieving goals?","How do you stay motivated?","Do your friends have similar dreams?","Have you talked about your dreams with anyone?","Can dreams change your life?","What's the first step toward your dream?","Have you taken any steps yet?","What qualities do they have?","What obstacles might you face?","Have you ever doubted yourself?","How did you regain confidence?","What's a goal you've already achieved?","Did you celebrate your achievement?","What did you learn from that experience?","Do you set goals regularly?","Are short-term or long-term goals more important?","How do you stay focused on your goals?","How do you handle setbacks?","Have you ever failed at something?","What did you learn from that failure?","Is failure necessary for success?","Would you encourage others to pursue their dreams?","What advice would you give to someone with big dreams?","Every great achievement started with a dream."]}
